## 1. Executive Summary

The Healthcare Hospital & Clinic Network Platform is a **multi-tenant SaaS marketplace** that connects patients with hospitals, clinics, doctors, diagnostic centers, and pharmacies, while giving each healthcare provider a full-featured CRM to run their daily operations.

The platform has three primary user-facing systems:

| System | Primary Users | Core Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| Public Website + Patient Portal | Patients / general public | Discover → Compare → Book → Manage healthcare |
| Hospital/Clinic CRM | Hospital admins, doctors, staff | Manage → Acquire patients → Operate → Analyze |
| Super Admin Panel | Platform owner/operator | Govern network, verification, subscriptions, ads, revenue |

The system is designed to be **production-grade** from day one: secure, scalable, API-first, and strictly data-isolated between organizations (tenants), while remaining simple enough for non-technical hospital staff to use daily.

