## 6. User Roles & Permissions

### 6.1 Role Hierarchy

**Platform Level**
- Super Admin — full platform control
- Platform Staff — limited operational access (support, moderation)

**Hospital/Clinic Level**
- Hospital Admin — full organization access
- Branch Admin — full access scoped to one branch
- Doctor — clinical access (own patients, records, prescriptions)
- Receptionist — patients, appointments, basic billing
- Nurse — patient care support, limited records access
- Accountant — billing, payments, financial reports
- Pharmacist — pharmacy/inventory
- Lab Staff — lab orders and reports
- Manager — operational oversight (configurable)

**Customer Level**
- Patient — self-service access to own data only

### 6.2 Permission Matrix (representative)

| Module | Hospital Admin | Doctor | Receptionist | Nurse | Accountant | Pharmacist | Lab Staff |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| Patients | Full | Assigned patients | Full (front-desk) | View + notes | View (billing context) | View (dispensing context) | View (lab context) |
| Appointments | Full | Own schedule | Full | View | View | — | View (lab bookings) |
| Medical Records | Full | Full (own patients) | — | View | — | — | Lab records only |
| Prescriptions | Full | Create/manage | — | — | — | View/dispense | — |
| Billing | Full | — | Basic (create bill) | — | Full | Pharmacy sales | Lab billing |
| Staff Management | Full | — | — | — | — | — | — |
| Inventory/Pharmacy | Full | — | — | — | — | Full | — |
| Reports & Analytics | Full | Own performance | — | — | Financial reports | Inventory reports | Lab reports |
| Settings | Full | — | — | — | — | — | — |

Permissions are **configurable per role** by the Hospital Admin (Enterprise tier supports custom roles), not hard-coded — the platform ships with sensible defaults per role above.

### 6.3 Patient Access

Patients can only ever access their **own** profile, appointments, records, prescriptions, bills, and messages. There is no patient-to-patient visibility, and no cross-organization visibility of a patient's records without explicit sharing/consent (e.g., a referral).

