**Modules:** Hospitals, Clinics, Doctors, Patients, Staff, Appointments, Payments, Subscriptions, Advertisements, Leads, Reviews, Services, Health Packages, Diagnostic Centers, Pharmacies, Reports, Complaints, Verification Requests, Platform Settings, Roles & Permissions, Audit Logs.

**Verification workflow:** hospitals/clinics submit organization name, owner name, contact details, address, registration/license documents; Super Admin can Review → Approve / Reject / Request Correction / Suspend. Approved organizations display a **Verified** badge platform-wide.

