## 12. Subscription & Monetization Model

### 12.1 Hospital/Clinic Subscription Tiers

| Plan | Price | Includes |
|---|---|---|
| **Starter** | ₹999/month | Patient Management, Appointment Management, Basic Dashboard |
| **Professional** | ₹2,499/month | Everything in Starter + Billing, Staff Management, Reports, Communication, Inventory |
| **Enterprise** | Custom pricing | Multi-branch, Advanced Analytics, API access, Custom Branding, Advanced Permissions, Dedicated Support |

Super Admin can create/edit plans and pricing; organizations upgrade/downgrade from their CRM Settings. Subscription status gates feature access at the API layer (not just UI).

### 12.2 Advertising Platform

Hospitals, clinics, doctors, diagnostic centers, and pharmacies can purchase advertising:

- **Types:** Homepage Banner, Search Result Promotion, Featured Hospital, Featured Doctor, Featured Clinic, Health Package Promotion.
- **Approval workflow:** Admin reviews and approves before publishing.
- **Statuses:** Pending → Approved → Active → Expired (or Rejected).
- **Tracked metrics:** Impressions, Clicks, Leads, Bookings — feeding both advertiser-facing performance reports and platform revenue analytics.

### 12.3 Lead Generation Revenue (optional model)

Leads generated through the platform can be routed to organizations as part of paid plans or sold as a value-add, tracked through the `leads` module with source and conversion attribution.

