## 14. Search & Discovery

- Global search across Hospitals, Clinics, Doctors, Services, Specializations, Diagnostic Centers, and Health Packages.
- **Location-aware search:** current location, city, state, PIN code, distance radius; results show distance, address, and map location.
- Search results respect visibility rules — only verified, active, and publicly-listed provider data appears; suspended or unverified organizations are excluded from public discovery until approved.
- Sponsored placements (from the Advertising module) are clearly distinguished from organic results.

