## 15. Analytics & Reporting

### 15.1 Hospital/Clinic CRM Analytics
Patient growth, appointment conversion rate, revenue, doctor performance, department performance, new vs. returning patients, cancellation rate, no-show rate.

### 15.2 Super Admin Platform Analytics
Platform growth, hospital acquisition, patient acquisition, revenue, subscription metrics (MRR, churn, upgrades), advertisement performance (impressions/clicks/conversion), city-wise distribution.

All analytics are computed from the same source-of-truth transactional tables (no shadow data), with tenant-scoped aggregation for CRM views and platform-wide aggregation for Super Admin views.

