## 18. MVP Roadmap (Phased Delivery)

### Phase 1 — Core Marketplace + CRM Foundation
**Patient:** Registration/Login, Search hospitals/clinics/doctors, Hospital profile, Doctor profile, Appointment booking, Patient dashboard.
**Hospital:** Registration, Verification, CRM dashboard, Patient management, Doctor management, Appointment management, Basic billing, Basic reports.
**Admin:** Hospital management, Patient management, Doctor management, Appointment management, Verification, Subscription management, Advertisement management.

### Phase 2 — Clinical & Operational Depth
Medical records, Prescriptions, Lab reports, Pharmacy, Inventory, Health packages, Reviews, Leads, Communication (chat).

### Phase 3 — Advanced Platform Capabilities
Advanced analytics, Telemedicine, AI features, Insurance integration, Ambulance booking, Home healthcare, native Mobile applications.

Each phase is additive and non-breaking with respect to the data model defined in §9 — future modules (telemedicine sessions, insurance claims, wearables data) attach to existing `patients`, `appointments`, and `organizations` entities rather than requiring restructuring.

